// A selected entry program binds its return value through the declared
// semantic only when that value is a scalar or a vector; matrix returns
// are handed to the profile binder and rejected there, exactly like
// hand-written struct matrix members.

float2x2 main(float4 p : POSITION) : TEXCOORD0
{
    float2x2 m;

    m[0] = p.xy;
    m[1] = p.zw;

    return m;
}
